      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "What you are describing is a very deep and painful feeling of guilt, but you are not a drain; you are a person going through a difficult health journey. Instead of focusing on what you can \"undo,\" perhaps you could focus on finding ways to ease their immediate stress. Small things, like taking over a household chore or simply acknowledging their exhaustion, can show them you see their efforts. Remember, caring for yourself is not selfish; it is the foundation for being able to care for others in the long run.",
